-- title:
--   Logical coordinates depend only on data and certificate wires
-- statement:
--   For any two physical basis strings, agreement on the body wires and on all certificate wires beyond the arithmetic workspace implies equality of their logical coordinates. The arithmetic workspace may differ arbitrarily.
--
--   $$
--   x_{\rm data}=y_{\rm data},\quad x_{\rm cert}=y_{\rm cert}\quad\Longrightarrow\quad\pi_{\rm logical}(x)=\pi_{\rm logical}(y).
--   $$
--
--   Here the logical projection reads the body and certificate registers. The identity allows arithmetic-workspace changes to be framed independently.
